{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"852768887728898098","name":"gamebooth-the-overconfident-intoxicant🍺🤮","position":93,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"Constitution-based gamebooth on Illo'fae. Rules: ‘Drinking’ game, not with alcohol per se but some other beverage 3 times a day (con check)","type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"constitution.png","id":"852769359670673438","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/852768887728898098/852769359670673438-constitution.png","message_id":"852769359959949325","sha256":"a234b14e55ca89f3d1f7ab3696dd7c70d11058e0a3d077a3368109e438c88ed8","size":170344,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/852768887728898098/852769359670673438/constitution.png?ex=6ac0875b&is=6abf35db&hm=4b348630fb0a5e5fcd056929991586de58dc4c2c5c0a13f795e2a188c6140a13&"}],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852768887728898098","content":"As you walk up to this booth you see a rather pale looking dwarf sitting behind the counter. Tankards of various sizes hang from the rafters. The Dwarf sees you approach and pours a bubbly drink into a mug and nudges it your way with a grunt. “Drink”. It smells incredibly inviting but something in the back of your brain screams “CAREFUL!”","created_at":"2021-06-11T04:40:59.103000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"852769359959949325","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852768887728898098","content":"**Rules: Drink the fluid. Don't throw up. (Make a constitution check, no modifier)\n\n3 tries per day.\n\nLimit one of each prize per player.**\n\n**If 14 or lower:** Your stomach churns, something about that drink doesn’t sit right with you. Seeing the look in your eye, Donnie pushes a bucket your way. You are unable to hold the drink down any longer. You also have disadvantage on constitution checks for the next 30 minutes.\n\n**DC 15-** (Load stone tankard weighs 1 pound empty, 50 pounds full)\nIf won, post: Donnie tips his chair back, grabs a tankard from a barrel behind him, and tosses it your way. \n\n**DC19-** Fey-aged fizz (the drink you are drinking. When drunk, roll of fey wild magic table)\nIf won, post: Donnie grunts and slides you a bottle from under the counter. It is labeled ‘Fey-aged Fizz’ upon further inspection it is the drink he was pouring you. \n\n**DC 23- **Tankard of Sobriety (can't get drunk if drinking from this mug)\nIf won, post: Donnie grunts and slides you a shiney tankard. It may be in your head but you swear you saw the side of his mouth curl up for a half a second.","created_at":"2021-06-11T04:41:34.417000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T18:26:33.665000Z","id":"852769508077600779","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
